                        Summary
                    </h2>

                    <p>
                        The <strong>align-content</strong> property
                        controls the alignment and spacing of multiple
                        Flex Lines along the cross axis. It is mainly
                        useful when <strong>flex-wrap: wrap;</strong>
                        creates multiple lines. Common values include
                        <strong>flex-start</strong>,
                        <strong>flex-end</strong>,
                        <strong>center</strong>,
                        <strong>space-between</strong>,
                        <strong>space-around</strong>, and
                        <strong>space-evenly</strong>.
                    </p>

